    "detailed_description": "You're a Ninja cast into the Sea and landed on an Island trapped by the Sea Lords.<br />\r\nWith your trusty ninja skills and the gold Hook you acquired, make your way out of the Island by defeating all your enemies...and the Marine Life around it.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCatch Fish, earn gold and defeat the Sea Lords to escape the Island! A top down shooter with a fishing twist. <br />\r\nWith your trusty hook you will hook dash, swing in the ocean, throw bombs, earn gold and fight your way out to victory.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nChain up to 200 catches and defeats bosses to obtain Scales in the Shrine to power up.<br />\r\nEarn Teeths for defeating bosses and earn permanent upgrades and gain access to multiple weapons that work better for different phases.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDefeat with the Sea Lords with all the Ninja tools you have!",
    "about_the_game": "You're a Ninja cast into the Sea and landed on an Island trapped by the Sea Lords.<br />\r\nWith your trusty ninja skills and the gold Hook you acquired, make your way out of the Island by defeating all your enemies...and the Marine Life around it.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCatch Fish, earn gold and defeat the Sea Lords to escape the Island! A top down shooter with a fishing twist. <br />\r\nWith your trusty hook you will hook dash, swing in the ocean, throw bombs, earn gold and fight your way out to victory.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nChain up to 200 catches and defeats bosses to obtain Scales in the Shrine to power up.<br />\r\nEarn Teeths for defeating bosses and earn permanent upgrades and gain access to multiple weapons that work better for different phases.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDefeat with the Sea Lords with all the Ninja tools you have!",
